SSH to VM from your laptop or remote system:
-------------------------------------------

1. Login into your VM and Check the listing tcp ports

Make sure SSH 22 in the list also check the IP range
````bash
user1@localhost ~]$ ss -ntl
````

2. Check the private IP of the VM
````bash
sudo ip -4 addr show
````

3. if SSH port 22 in the list, than

Open CMD in remote machine run the below command

````bash
ssh user1@192.168.88.128
````
enter Password of the user1.



